{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 582,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:940b9c522c35beac18f6fb38",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对、对不起。因为太紧张，所以\\n脸色有点苍白……我、我会加油的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "46bf555db34615d240c4e6923151673a82593efc2c6db754017b5c9f58cc9c05",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "538"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5ad1fa3066a8939409db5e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那、那个，从我的嘴里\\n说出好歌剧的名字……真的可以吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "433d0145464536da872854248e24f68f2b56f8576095b8dee7face45aeee4f6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "539"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:331b808e2a4ec6c17bafebde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是累积过人的锻炼。在绝对的自信面前，\\n紧张感只不过是沧海一粟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbba76fe69f15b674faa9c9b060a9b87e51fe3b4f10331aff43ea2fc6fc49e9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "54"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e12b933de1775a3fc0cc2000",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是无论发生什么事都要跑到最后……\\n对、对不起，我一副很了不起的样子……",
      "source_fingerprint": "576c8892ffa594624404afbc8c5e1d4537055917ce954b2fc8f5630d3f4a74d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "540"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2879f2c1ee9f2b8d82278298",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……是熏衣草的香氛。\\n可以缓和我的紧张情绪，所以才……",
      "source_fingerprint": "186a6483f0cbe7e6d9ba3c125d361e3adcbdca10f203dd6c6c56207c1f8da29f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "541"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d83669a95e70138c97f0d47b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦……为什么会知道……\\n爸爸真是的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3addf15a6be22b628ffd9793375d47444c2b23dd573c2ddfdfa9a7d72c0ee75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "542"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e26cb299a70c9fb99a4040f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我说的话根本……不过……好吧。\\n我会加油不让大家失望……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfa098f4d5cc77c1d6457cee4eb6f40d46e99cff0885f6075e3081e1a30ba6ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "543"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d85096d69278affde24ce532",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为最近网络上的广告影片也很有看头……\\n等我把东西放进购物车后才清醒过来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e7d88ca05137a280254045a4bf562ac45de1e4d3509e6fac04313adc09c2149",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "544"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:701333561f7f86873cbc3c44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会非常打拼，请多指教咧～！\\n……呃，为什么是福冈腔！？（笑）",
      "source_fingerprint": "132877ebbbf34ab0705c1bdacea0e77fdce2928de2ba4e9a7fb166acb049ea93",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "545"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64a427474e11f164b535bb0a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯。用纵横赛场的表现登上综合情报节目。\\n哈哈……刚、刚才的还是剪掉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36fa10beecf76cccdaa166c08e029371d3819a1737a971cd0f23cff41e876881",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "546"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56dfe6eab5b65f0ea9d6eb76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "帝王奔驰不但练习距离比任何人都长，而且还\\n兼顾质量！好好期待正式竞赛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc7b225bc347964f72ecb9368eab0474a280d8be71c15a5259f9a7b105e4f39c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "547"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df9fc879088a74b3262b1434",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为天空推荐的教科书，白白浪费了时间！\\n猫猫威能是什么啦！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "03b9d9ab72ef6087d520aae05dda3d85db22c9a3c196477215dee424b779ae46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "548"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6af2be09965fceedfc96d8f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通常会出门逛街买东西。不用邮购，\\n因为我要用自己的眼睛看穿哪些才是一流的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e76117cdd31a9ef1591cb39cf05c5d9a25d644baac6a359d30ef1d4c1fd8cfa3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "549"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb3dd03de82922842e54e87",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家今天也会挥洒青春的汗水吧！\\n我会到最前线好好欣赏！看我的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2acf729815960eab3fc640a5716b5ba8a799dae6a881b77550f91201dba9ab4a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "55"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e86e95791cfba11ae44682f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "觉、觉得很辣……当时因为想确定这不是梦，\\n所以我直接咬了洋葱……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fde817eaba72d9df8a1f2e6817c0c09259c24f32d02e3a4f5145603af9ef3826",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "550"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:818fa588100a1d46d755f581",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～想对很多人表示感谢。当然，\\n到时候也会一并向他们报告我获得了优胜！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3795f0eb4cb41ec1569fef818d1e40e23e742a54528f8a2aea800e83e920d0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "551"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61fc59fb495e03daaa00c194",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有……我是因为单纯喜欢跑步才奔跑的。\\n这点之后也不会改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a84f8e67f422b37fa76accb297279f020003c40a0b34ec35b13fdb8150079d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "552"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9034eb3f831b25809e2cfb15",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想参加各种竞赛，从中见识还没有\\n看过的景色。试着拜托看看好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf04ae74c7c73bda84b7021ee0740e7ef9d0f50eae3152f9f04c3168617030f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "553"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51bfdbe7441a0283c5a06826",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……当然是那些替我加油的所有粉丝们啊！\\n这还用问吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cd958c01631738524264345e610376bd6f01315c11134553967023c05355e46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "554"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:213405a4ff68537643bfcf91",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我接受挑战！我既不会跑也不会躲……\\n不……若被追上还是会跑就是，嘿嘿嘿～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "adba1586e95c49ad0f4f1cd2cc1b16276e31efc3a7afa32b4d0a6475a23ad693",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "555"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04f8675a7c9e6d64f2c6bc49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，我还不会让路给你们喔。\\n有时也勇敢踩下油门奔驰吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "738f51313bc146bc121258d6568e3b2d3c722f2e87accf3cd339391bfd6ac8f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "556"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2f3a3cf2d08506c8cfa8c79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀，全都不能漏看喔？就跟流行一样，\\n瞬间就会被抛在后面的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b970fca6fbe024356b2d9b43f9fd2b76b069114d38d1f405934331da3b3eaeb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "557"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d6ac46d9b8382cce56564cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，你摸摸右边的口袋看看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a004473ab0e798af219d8f976f2a9f4ef47778e172a9a1326007cba777980c8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "558"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbf8abdc91914ad404554052",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感谢大家平常的支持。\\n我会为了你们创造奇迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9251d47999dde7c519db829b55a78237a63cd421db622fbf256364b115d888cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "559"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3108293f7e11d2ab09e5770b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咿呀！意思是叫我选出谁是主推吗！？\\n办、办不到！我是箱推！所有赛马娘都很尊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecac65aa20bcfdd6a3b602be43600a875a69230717507bc9b08f6bc9aaa1b236",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "56"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8f7f6213e51c38afb18a674",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鱿鱼……螃蟹……嗯，我都喜欢，\\n尤其是鱿鱼烧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe6644ae559b7f49e8caada3477ff773bcc90b34021c0ee3d44e38b7b94153c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "560"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59e62c47f21609af6b33a0b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……无法只用一句话总结。所以希望大家注目\\n于我的表现。我想表达的──应该都在里面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b355738733ed9a854c6bfed8b2ff65ef52354a93c613b02b6250d421334d4a9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "561"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66ab0f48f7eb7dc82171e470",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然有针对赛道变形机关拟定对策，\\n但我忘记指令是什么了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "093fbf071c3b7be985c99fb685767bce2f30864e141364c3e8677f700f353bfc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "562"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1ee4429db1f551d4d779417",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喝──啊！！被我透过函授教育学到的\\n「截拳道」吓得连睡觉都会发抖吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2c632dfbe6804fa08dd34bde3ceeb67b77ae928784d4e8381479080d7290ed5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "563"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09f05325ac55bd9ea3f12d77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "还是叫「史上最强」比较帅吧！！\\n啊～如果绣在袖子上会被骂吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5965c2b1925c68ed22aaf16cc5d87f2c97a9a5cd56c242f1f1c075fa0cd62fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "564"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:779dfd2a5099985aab02a6fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唔～我不擅长数字这类琐碎的事情。\\n总而言之，我会尽全力冲刺！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd50063056bf4aa166764ba655fca1d419c7dfc9fb194a02612e6545e99b46d5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "565"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00186a48dbae4aa8783cfd2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我不认为能轻松拿到第1，\\n所以我比任何人都努力练习！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d35fbac626738e269167b294d76797b505fa2efebc4ca4448be65bb73a29edb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "566"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7c35aab69c3aa690cdbe462",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……求之不得！请准备刊登\\n「大和赤骥获得优胜」的特辑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "976c76a9f6f1c19ac04fa014c424f806c01f6a094be6708870e464697f518a08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "567"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95d365373e1cfa6587ddd0f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "像bison那样冲刺！放牛吃草喔！\\nWell……我有说对吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7bdd24c0f388bf79ad4c637e76ad6f32dc24b80eff15d5f4f2ade72bc7ea894",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "568"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4fd8309cd6a0618c53b255b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "I'll pass！这些话要与smile\\n和victory一起传达给他们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbfb5923ba5079b1e23cfce7a6f99301a248bb007fae75723f30ef564a4f89ff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "569"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84402f68f56e2a827ecc36c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "顺从热情，认真地去跑。\\n如此一来我想冠军的荣耀就会在前方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe82cbc9c19ba114dcc89f63c62f5c11db4d1a2bd1bb50d6916665c485e7ccbf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "57"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:218ed1a1a574666785b25c7b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "作为对手没有不足之处，\\n我打算以坚定不移的决心来面对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdf278634c8e8557a5cfafdb022d932231574adbc0e214a51391cf2e761009eb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "570"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5984b8d8e8256e682432cb93",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然已经准备万全。粉丝们所期待的真正实力\\n──现在正是让大家见识的时候。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00ff37cd2f41cfd4b8a2e102ed763d6ef3eea1bc055f4ec029744be3109a7e25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "571"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddec7d80a0d12477cce449e8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说不会是骗人的，但比起那个……\\n这么激昂的气氛会令人兴奋得坐立难安呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e2949ecbe851277dfa7fbf438cf0e66468a248e6261c721793486a949d834f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "572"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e269e8220eee5c66d0959a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会好好地迎战所有人，\\n尽管上前正面交锋吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "263585c3feec5e52fbaccd449666f0172a926f6288f532e77757822dff591e78",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "573"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aa38e23a3d9d60bf0554a32",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这时候才搞小动作没有用。\\n我只相信过去每天的勤奋练习！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2980962f0d3f2d5ee2c46b711c1a95aafa0cfd896b5d5dd3d8083b1fa988c79",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "574"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cfc1a408dcabbd63dc6f849",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然很兴奋。和日本大赛的全垒打……\\n不，是和跑天皇赏的时候一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d363793a472b18369b91558435e30823aa33bf5068d549b8c5c6b0143c5df0b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "575"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1825a9a68ad93448cca72fa7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然、绝对、一目了然！\\n注定会是神鹰我获得胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfcc5274ef8a30effec8317d89c9134ec410880fa599976b7a973581f0083624",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "576"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553c3c3890535b73808073f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "爸爸、妈妈、训练员……希望世界上的\\n所有人都能在此祝福我～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99ae56b7348be053d1140dbf333d575caabc67e2e94b0a32c7c0a6d0d02124c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "577"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:918844a01d64a178a7975479",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望大家连我的每一个呼吸声都不要错过呢！\\n好，装上麦克风用喇叭放出来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1c72ee3e8308f32f18370929e04c9fd2d92263f4a455a7fbba8545e481cf018",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "578"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dd2a2694d7d948f273aac0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想献给后世的芸芸众生。为此，\\n我打算将这场竞赛写成戏曲！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36e9bf7fbe1297d5ad119d0ac0c2c12d0ac8e8e706699a1b7399a15dad434d4d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "579"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:594a51ea26a2c86ec79ed017",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～该怎么说才好呢？有时有钓到，\\n有时没钓到，有时睡着了，各种状况都有。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b79ba879e7f7f90a8f09590bf260baa449c02023f8b83c7c55be41fd53a77f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "58"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02e9429f111767b9240c3286",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……谁要参赛、要在哪里跑都没差。\\n只要将对手远远甩在后面就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "630a3ead5a18dc5e965be5130cb3d31fbcd79ed40b45f5f5cd0177cc7f85f932",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "580"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b74756b32c30cece003aa2fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵……那是开赛的信号。\\n没有人会因此不热血沸腾吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5465a2eb60a70a44e46929285ad4883fead3de49cfaff8de82cd8509166b4dc7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "581"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f180ed948d7f42f8dd0b41b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然想用从容不迫的态度面对，但仍\\n按捺不住兴奋。我的修行还不够呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e3f490ff958fd50fb2ec91be4fc8e34658c84d36da7e6c6ce3b9988ead96771",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "582"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:342ff0cb6d93c7b703835d7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有想过换个让实况比较好念的名字……\\n呵呵，开玩笑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c14285f67aad06d1e453117fa713640220db6624d42a428e3d44c4fd1918eba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "583"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d22aa932053cc101c5ef0945",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你以为我会说吗？哼，反正就算我曝露\\n自己的底牌也不会撼动属于我的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d2f75d754d3643a39bb78dca0485ebb49f75414eab5c30c954263f57ff2fc8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "584"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:080155998e8b67ffc3c6335c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～那我要对母亲说……\\n有字数限制吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ba6e9eb5631fc04fa6a9687643f211548b08ded737c6c0da8046e684acb4a7b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "585"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:991fd0d6943fa0eec47ef125",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦！？呃，我、我、我很高兴……\\n我是真的很高兴喔！？你是认真的吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "90924d6a5dc1e61ecea8babc80a76c19d4a554bcd74c413262bb5f4924b79281",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "586"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0e63dd4b03c272602814fc7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是场赛马娘们彼此激烈竞争的崇高竞赛。\\n我会全力以赴来表达对它的敬意喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e129f42ad3f0981bbf2c2ac36d3f7488e560fa60ae11ef1abf1505d3e811eb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "587"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca4cc650d3622da2ebe199da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实我梦到像现在这样接受你的采访。\\n开玩笑的，别当真别当真。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abb1f14f4a6a33b5993d60477b85d7fda0a4d87495fd0ebaf7cbcfc0cc198b04",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "588"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c528c1e96c1df5f241de0df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，我知道了啦～毕竟是决赛，大家都会\\n「看得」很仔细吧……？我会鼓起干劲的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbc3717c5921df141a7d74882801dec716346758e572304b5e265730346b4049",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "589"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a2ecf6c743c974bf5092fe8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然。我们昨天也一起睡了午觉哟～\\n真是个好天气呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "659df5a10eecd9e602a057f4835d568c90c90cd34a373063125b3f11733958c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "59"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d1ee761e12ea8468151de5f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会吃加了很多肉的炒豆芽菜！\\n训练员！就拜托你准备好钱包啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c8e0c4765bc88ddf720b85ed95ab23ee8d3cfdcf3d80bf5a0a956bcc866290c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "590"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a6faffa79c376f96100ccda",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要笑就趁现在吧～\\n反正很快就会让你们哭出来啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11bbd3e91580eb2ab5db68f6dc7b9e027e15c576d128574ebdc9bde706b3d593",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "591"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b15fd2045418a8280d58dfd4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想尽自己的全力去跑……\\n好让这场比赛成为在日本经历过的重要回忆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51e65958b25400ae07c12dbdccedc5c54a31e8eeb90d45160d7e14e1f0caf2a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "592"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d508add8baa81f80eba51765",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我有时也会自豪地赌上\\n包括自信与干劲的一切而跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c8000d64f7ebe6cfc0c8093cdd4c9a7ddb46e79342b45742928cb4b623d2d86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "593"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2728777953eb6131d77a8e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是为了获得常胜的理论，以及……\\n能够选择继续跑下去的支柱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33e361772eeb06004697bfdb1f3af1d8dcf928648e7fb627d0a7cc13a17de867",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "594"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab76f89ff91b9b69144201f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身边有个不得了的怪物存在……\\n不断困扰着我呢，但也因此才有现在的我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fd1e3b9dd8e97f6b3ba9a0260f6954b3c46209f0120a38ea18998dee2fafb72",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "595"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4decc6531ad8d021346ff149",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好期待～♪我想她应该会那样跑，\\n而她一定会……嗯～好想赶快开始跑喔──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e3ef83dae074f686ad47d465467864f67fb16ca0de1dafb834742332f8375dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "596"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4be3ee92824c534e8ecdbce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "毕竟训练员有帮我加油啊☆\\n我比平常更不觉得会输呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1f96366a022dceb5fd456d59d94a1aa529797d4f1a04768a72b230b31f65894",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "597"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07baa8a31de0ffe5c5714b43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "干劲也要……用高压萃取法。\\n使尽地，把它们浓缩起来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9378b6b02e4afa46b9fd2be4768c539067d86d704e3c53db11a7a58e88ca60d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "598"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ce39d50b9d1d1ecf3a2067b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我不会……把第1让出来。可以比我\\n更快抵达终点的……只有她……",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb1d1028204e87da7009faed98b77173f8fe99976eb3a6945b1eded926a800f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "599"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad55977bd0208e1e5930a095",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起跑后就听不见周围的声音……但抵达终点后\\n听见的欢呼声让人很畅快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e1935afd9dd45087ec3ae4f624f99217ecde4dd43bbd331076816f4feffff3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb865db7a0f053023205f27e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～～果然还是要放轻松不能着急，\\n然后看准时机的感觉吧？呀哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4300eaa0ea2ae6df41f67c3b620fce3198abc100220d114c4f5ccc7287485b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "60"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcf9b34ef160dc062f49b136",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "胸口变得很热，就快要超载了。\\n……我很想赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5e0c8f40dda806dd0d25447ac20e84b05ffa457c1b7cf049fcfc3af5db8ec58",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "600"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fcbe2046044aecfbddede29",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "开始执行指令。嘻，呵……发生错误。\\n会在获得优胜后重新搜寻笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a86a78d8972e0c9d93cea8e817e74c1bbc29c90cf44fbbd422239114962d5aad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "601"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c9eacce1056d10a0cf74cbf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "已经在训练时拚尽全力落实每一下动作！\\n我会发挥那个成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1212603a21f110efdf43d7d4d950d746f8419547d6c2b7a9dbd100bb77d9c430",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "602"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8484214d3e1e382c41048701",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "还是希望大家能看看这充满活力的肌肉！\\n因为它们是与我共同奋战的伙伴！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecb36c2b1cd42c84b0fc1a00db73bb08ca5de8b8db60d53906afc4641fd1d995",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "603"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52cfda1c90c01cc54ebc85b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "觉得非常期待♪因为认真一较高下后的\\n餐点会非常美味～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f785b0d004f34e033ce487094ff99de77969cbca75aa4b8ac25900cf0d869fea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "604"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:397fd070cf76b63feb578ee8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Buono♪用尽全力较量过后，\\n大家相亲相爱来开火锅派对吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "532ec592f196c8dfd3bcbf463c3e63e95958acf0341abbd8eda548e982a05f3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "605"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc7561ec1860a88758a21f20",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哇啊！那我得挥挥手……不对。\\n我得全力以赴拿下第一名才行呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "649e2475d4972a335cca2e67d37aa28e8f67811850edc8b64a621d8283d28914",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "606"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e215912d0008e55f0aba34a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然对手都很耀眼看起来又很强……\\n但我也不想输……我一定会赢的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48b420732878ece8cd727b8e8e0ba7281b8ba19452e7e5e15fd5c874b965ad6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "607"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:919039fb40693671318a1435",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……唔！那个、那个！米浴也有受到鼓励，\\n所以……好开心喔……嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41bb705e06125b2cd015c0975b4de38ecf484c83ca93f65c38acba27d44db7a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "608"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0196301d2caf56b6e54e0d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦、咦、什么！？那个…………\\n…………都、都将由我收下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbcd1a7c84997b704e0a65fbcceb44ed1cfd76cd4ed38ecf773e1b623fb691db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "609"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
